Jani-King is a franchise system, so the build must be anchored to one specific franchise owner: the Lafayette regional office sells and supports, and independent unit franchisees do the cleaning.

Who we are building for
Jani-King of Lafayette is a regional support office inside the Jani-King Gulf Coast region, not a single cleaning company with its own crew. The Lafayette/Lake Charles office has offered commercial cleaning franchise opportunities and services since 2004, per the One Acadiana directory. The cleaning itself is done by independent unit franchise owners, who the regional page describes as following proven systems.

