Module C: Training Academy (free only)
House rule stays: free only, no exam fees, no paid courses. The research adds one source to check first: Jani-King advertises complete training for franchise owners and its own surgical cleaning technician program, so the owner may already have free access to franchisor training. Ask him before building duplicate lessons.

How unlocking works. The final seconds of each lesson are the key to the next one. The player unlocks the next lesson only after real watch time (about 90 percent, no skipping ahead) reaches the last five seconds. A 3-tap check after each lesson is optional but makes the log believable. The owner can open a status page any time.

